### GET /api/hiring-requests — hiring.index
GET {{host}}/api/hiring-requests
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/hiring-requests — hiring.store
POST {{host}}/api/hiring-requests
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Example title",
    "branch_id": 1,
    "reason": "new_position"
}

